<div class="page-head">
    <div class="page-head-text">
        <h1>Customers</h1>
        <p>The businesses you deliver to, with their addresses and terms.</p>
    </div>
    <div class="page-head-actions">
        <button class="btn btn--brand btn--solid" type="button"><i class="ri-add-line"></i> <span>New customer</span></button>
    </div>
</div>

<section class="card">
    <div class="empty-state">
        <svg class="state-art" aria-hidden="true"><use href="#first-run" /></svg>
        <span class="empty-state-title">No customers yet</span>
        <p>Add the businesses you deliver to, and orders can be raised for them. Bring a list you already keep, or start with one.</p>
        <div class="empty-state-actions">
            <button class="btn btn--brand btn--solid" type="button"><i class="ri-upload-2-line"></i> <span>Import a spreadsheet</span></button>
            <button class="btn" type="button"><i class="ri-add-line"></i> <span>Add one by hand</span></button>
        </div>
    </div>
</section>

<div class="sedna-grid sedna-grid--fit">
    <section class="card">
        <div class="card-head"><h3>What an import needs</h3></div>
        <div class="card-body">
            <p class="form-hint">A CSV or XLSX file with a name and a delivery address on each row. Anything else is optional and can be added later.</p>
        </div>
        <div class="card-foot card-foot--start"><a href="#">Download a template</a></div>
    </section>
    <section class="card">
        <div class="card-head"><h3>Who can see them</h3></div>
        <div class="card-body">
            <p class="form-hint">Everyone on the Fulfilment team. Payment terms are shown to account leads only.</p>
        </div>
        <div class="card-foot card-foot--start"><a href="#">Change who can see them</a></div>
    </section>
</div>
